"""ocplab — CLI for the OpenShift UPI on AWS lab.

Thin layer over Ansible and Terraform: validates `cluster.yaml`, translates
it into `terraform/terraform.tfvars` and
`ansible/inventory/group_vars/all/generated.yml`, and invokes
`ansible-playbook`. No business logic of its own — that lives in the
Ansible roles (see CLAUDE.md).
"""
